---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy & PDPA Statement - AmerisPro">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="legal-header">
        <span class="legal-badge">🔒 Legal & Data Privacy</span>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy & Notis PDPA</h1>
        <p class="legal-subtitle">
          AmerisPro is committed to protecting your personal data in accordance with the 
          <strong>Malaysian Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (Act 709)</strong> and international <strong>GDPR standards</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-meta">
          <span>Effective Date: July 25, 2026</span> • <span>Version 2.0</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Language Switcher Tabs -->
      <div class="lang-tabs">
        <button type="button" id="tab-en" class="lang-btn active">
          🇬🇧 English (Global & PDPA)
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="tab-bm" class="lang-btn">
          🇲🇾 Bahasa Melayu (Notis PDPA)
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- ENGLISH SECTION -->
      <div id="content-en" class="legal-body">
        
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Overview & Principles</h2>
          <p>
            This Privacy Policy explains how AmerisPro ("we," "our," or "us") collects, processes, and safeguards data when you use the AmerisPro Safety Hub SaaS platform ("Service").
          </p>
          <p>
            We process your personal and organizational data strictly in compliance with the seven Core Principles of the Malaysian Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA) and global General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) standards.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>To provide our safety management and compliance services, we collect:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Account & Organization Data:</strong> Name, work email address, company/tenant name, and workspace preferences collected during user registration or Google OAuth sign-in.</li>
            <li><strong>Safety & Operational Records:</strong> Site inspection logs, incident reports, PPE stock balances, contractor registrations, staff directory data, and digital signature records created within your workspace.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical & Usage Data:</strong> IP addresses, browser types, and session tokens necessary for secure authentication and system operation.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. Purpose of Processing & Third-Party Disclosure</h2>
          <p>Your data is processed exclusively to deliver, maintain, and secure the AmerisPro platform. We never sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties.</p>
          <p>Data may be processed by trusted infrastructure sub-processors essential to service delivery:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Cloud Database & Storage:</strong> Encrypted hosting provided via Supabase Cloud in secure regional data centers (Singapore region).</li>
            <li><strong>Application Infrastructure:</strong> Serverless web hosting and edge routing provided via Vercel Inc.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment Gateways:</strong> Secure transaction processing for subscriptions via licensed payment partners.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. AI Search & Data Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            AmerisPro provides automated search and compliance assistance tools to help organizations reference relevant safety statutes, codes of practice, and regulatory guidelines.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Data Confidentiality:</strong> Your workspace records, private site inspection logs, uploaded photos, and personnel directories are <strong>never used to train public AI models</strong> or disclosed to unauthorized external entities.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Data Security & Retention</h2>
          <p>
            We implement multi-layered security controls, including SSL/TLS 256-bit encryption in transit and PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) data isolation per organization.
          </p>
          <p>
            Your workspace data is retained for the duration of your active subscription. You retain full rights to request complete data export or workspace deletion at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>6. Contact & Data Access Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Under the PDPA Act 709 and applicable privacy laws, you have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data.
          </p>
          <p>
            For any privacy inquiries or data requests, please contact our support team at: <a href="mailto:support@amerispro.com" class="legal-link">support@amerispro.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <!-- BAHASA MELAYU SECTION -->
      <div id="content-bm" class="legal-body" hidden>
        
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Notis Perlindungan Data Peribadi (Akta 709)</h2>
          <p>
            Notis ini dikeluarkan mengikut keperluan Seksyen 7 Akta Perlindungan Data Peribadi 2010 (PDPA) Malaysia. AmerisPro ("kami") komited untuk memelihara kerahsiaan dan keselamatan data peribadi anda.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Pengumpulan dan Pemprosesan Data</h2>
          <p>Kami mengumpul maklumat akaun, nama organisasi, alamat e-mel, dan rekod pengurusan keselamatan tapak yang dimasukkan oleh anda untuk tujuan perkhidmatan sistem SaaS AmerisPro.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. Keselamatan dan Hak Pengguna</h2>
          <p>
            Semua data disimpan secara selamat menggunakan penyulitan data terkini. Data anda tidak akan dijual atau dikongsi kepada pihak ketiga tanpa kebenaran.
          </p>
          <p>
            Anda berhak mengikut Akta 709 untuk mengakses, membetulkan, memuat turun, atau meminta pemadaman data peribadi anda dengan menghubungi kami di: <a href="mailto:support@amerispro.com" class="legal-link">support@amerispro.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer class="legal-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 AmerisPro. All rights reserved.</p>
      </footer>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  const btnEn = document.getElementById('tab-en');
  const btnBm = document.getElementById('tab-bm');
  const contentEn = document.getElementById('content-en');
  const contentBm = document.getElementById('content-bm');

  if (btnEn && btnBm && contentEn && contentBm) {
    btnEn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      btnEn.classList.add('active');
      btnBm.classList.remove('active');
      contentEn.hidden = false;
      contentBm.hidden = true;
    });

    btnBm.addEventListener('click', () => {
      btnBm.classList.add('active');
      btnEn.classList.remove('active');
      contentBm.hidden = false;
      contentEn.hidden = true;
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 48px 20px 80px;
    background: #FFF9EC;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
    color: #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 44px;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .legal-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #FFD166;
    border: 2px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #4A4E69;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #6C757D;
  }

  /* Lang Tabs */
  .lang-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .lang-btn {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #FFF9EC;
    color: #2B2D42;
    border: 2px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #2B2D42;
    transition: transform 0.1s, background 0.1s;
  }

  .lang-btn.active {
    background: #FFD166;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .lang-btn:hover:not(.active) {
    background: #FFEED2;
  }

  /* Content */
  .legal-body {
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #2B2D42;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #333333;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #333333;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .legal-link {
    color: #2B2D42;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-footer {
    border-top: 2px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #6C757D;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-container {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .legal-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
